          "local_term": "Clause",
          "akn_element": "subsection",
          "level": "subdivision",
          "bluebell_keyword": "SUBSECTION",
          "numbering": "arabic_parenthesized"
        }
      ],
      "hcontainers": [],
      "note": "1992 Constitution has 26 Chapters with Articles as the basic unit. Articles are cited as 'Article 106' not 'section 106'. Map Article -> section in AKN for structural purposes; display layer renders as 'Article'."
